Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,the Spurs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:01.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rockets stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,playing basketball
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,and sent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:04.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,in their mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Texas ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:05.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,big enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,for two mascots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Spurs Coyote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Rockets Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:10.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,High noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:11.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,One hoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:12.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,San Antonio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,is 15 and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:13.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,3, first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:15.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Houston is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:15.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,13 and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:17.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,5, right behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:17.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the mascots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,are settling it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:19.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the Texas way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:20.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,In this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,corner: the Coyote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:21.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:23.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,since 1983, Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Fame, 2007,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:25.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:26.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,coyote runs 43
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,And in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,this corner: Clutch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,since 95, Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Fame, 2006,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,one year earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,He made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,sure you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:36.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,7 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:36.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,a real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,grizzly runs 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch's official name
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,is Houston's number
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,one fan, Clutch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:43.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Rockets Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:43.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,By the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:43.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,time he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:44.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,finished introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:45.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,himself, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:46.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,coyote scored twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:47.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,But there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:48.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,In 2005,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:49.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,the coyote became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:50.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first mascot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:51.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,in NBA history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,to get ejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:53.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the ref
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:54.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,is watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,very closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote crosses over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch doesn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote crosses back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:00.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:01.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,doesn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:02.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Clutch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:02.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,just sits
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:04.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,And here's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:04.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:05.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:05.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,old Houston theory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:06.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,that Clutch isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:07.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,even a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:07.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:08.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,a mashup
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:08.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,of every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:10.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:11.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Turtle shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Eagle wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:13.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Elephant trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:14.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch flies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:14.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,over the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,barn and dunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote fouls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:17.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,him mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:17.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:18.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:20.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,21 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:21.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Spurs fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:21.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,say that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:22.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,wasn't a foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:23.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rockets fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:23.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,say that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:24.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,wasn't a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:25.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comment who wins!
